    <fr:title text="Capture URL shortcut">Capture URL shortcut</fr:title>
  </fr:frontmatter>
  <fr:mainmatter>
    <html:p>Safari share-sheet shortcut: consumes the current page URL as its input and POSTs it form-encoded to <html:code>/capture</html:code>. The server tags the resulting tree with <html:code>webclip</html:code>.</html:p>
    <html:p>Generated by <html:code>build_url()</html:code> in <html:code>~/forest/utils/gen-capture-shortcuts.py</html:code>:</html:p>
    <html:pre><![CDATA[def build_url():
    download_uuid = uid()
    actions = [
        download_url_json(
            ENDPOINT,
            [("url", tok_shortcut_input_ref())],
            uuid_=download_uuid,
        ),
        *trailing_notify(download_uuid),
    ]
    return top_level(actions, share_sheet_types=["WFURLContentItem"])]]></html:pre>
    <html:p><html:code>tok_shortcut_input_ref()</html:code> is the pure <html:code>ExtensionInput</html:code> reference (a <html:code>WFTextTokenAttachment</html:code>, not a templated string) — the form value reads the share-sheet URL directly.</html:p>
  </fr:mainmatter>
